  "title": "Tax procedure case file",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Tax procedure case file</h2><p>Prepare a procedural action summary and a penalty calculation using the stated assumptions.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"reg-m1-tbs2-f1\">Potential prepayment forum</label><select id=\"reg-m1-tbs2-f1\"><option value=\"U.S. Tax Court\">U.S. Tax Court</option><option value=\"A refund suit without any prerequisites\">A refund suit without any prerequisites</option><option value=\"Only a state small-claims court\">Only a state small-claims court</option><option value=\"Only private mediation\">Only private mediation</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"reg-m1-tbs2-f2\">Assessment-period implication of nonfiling</label><select id=\"reg-m1-tbs2-f2\"><option value=\"The ordinary three-year period does not automatically close assessment\">The ordinary three-year period does not automatically close assessment</option><option value=\"Assessment always closes after one year\">Assessment always closes after one year</option><option value=\"Nonfiling eliminates all tax\">Nonfiling eliminates all tax</option><option value=\"No records are relevant\">No records are relevant</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"reg-m1-tbs2-f3\">Specified late-payment penalty</label><input id=\"reg-m1-tbs2-f3\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"reg-m1-tbs2-f4\">Foreign-reporting conclusion</label><select id=\"reg-m1-tbs2-f4\"><option value=\"Evaluate separate applicable information-reporting requirements\">Evaluate separate applicable information-reporting requirements</option><option value=\"Income reporting always satisfies everything\">Income reporting always satisfies everything</option><option value=\"Currency denomination determines all duties\">Currency denomination determines all duties</option><option value=\"No foreign accounts are reportable\">No foreign accounts are reportable</option></select></div></section>",
