  "explanation": "<h3>Potential prepayment forum</h3><p>Tax Court generally provides a deficiency prepayment forum when requirements are met.</p><h3>Assessment-period implication of nonfiling</h3><p>Failure to file is an exception requiring separate analysis.</p><h3>Specified late-payment penalty</h3><p>$40,000 × .005 × 5 = $1,000.</p><h3>Foreign-reporting conclusion</h3><p>Income and account-information reporting are distinct obligations.</p>"
